ing full HD graphics<br></li><li> Special challenges for skilled players on difficult mode<br></li><li> Tour the world<br></li><li> A fascinating plot and interesting characters<br></li><li> Puzzles and bonus levels for the attentive players<br></li><li> A chance to save the world and get the treasure<br></li><li> Steam trading cards, backgrounds, wallpapers, smiles and other bonus stuff! (once they will be available)</li></ul>",
